The witness guest for E7c (#1278, ADR 0126) — provenance, per ADR 0114's rule for committed guest binaries. Like
p3tcp, it is reproducible from this repository plus the pinned toolchain: p3lookup/build.sh rebuilds it offline, and
builds its peer from ../p3tcp/echo/.

Source:       src/main.rs, Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock (this directory). No dependencies and no WIT of its own: its
              imports are the ones Rust std and wasi-libc make for a wasm32-wasip3 program that resolves names and
              connects to one.
